The files below come from https://github.com/0xpili/simplified-technical-english
(commit 1e148d670cba46685ad2b4c3f2354a637a7fdbbe). The file references/english.md
gives the text of the SKILL.md file of that repository in Korean.

- NOTICE.md
- references/writing-rules.md
- references/word-list.md
- references/substitutions.md
- examples/before-after.md
- scripts/ste_check.py

We wrote the instructions in references/writing-rules.md, references/word-list.md,
references/substitutions.md, and examples/before-after.md again in Korean.
The approved words, the replacement words, and the English examples did not change.

The license below applies to these files and to references/english.md.

